<title>CHILE: SOCCER-COLO COLO BEAT FLAMENGO 1-0 SUPERCUP QUARTER-FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLO COLO BEAT FLAMENGO 1-0 SUPERCUP QUARTER-FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colo Colo (Chile) beat Flamengo</p>
<p>(Brazil) 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a South American Supercup</p>
<p>quarter-final, second leg match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Marcelo Espina (86th minute)</p>
<p>Colo Colo win 2-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
